<title>NETHERLANDS: Oce sets 1995/96 stock div at one per 121.</title>
<headline>Oce sets 1995/96 stock div at one per 121.</headline>
<dateline>VENLO, Netherlands 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Photocopier maker Oce NV said on Tuesday it had set its 1995/96 optional final stock dividend at one new share per 121 held.</p>
<p>In February, Oce announced it would pay a 1995/96 cash dividend of 3.00 guilders, of which 0.90 had alreay been paid as an interim dividend. The final payment could be taken up in cash or as an alternative dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Oce shares closed at 242.50 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Tuesday, down 1.10 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
